@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085
@superAdminToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_SUPER_ADMIN_JWT
@userId = 123

### Nâng tài khoản USER ACTIVE đã xác minh email
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"ADMIN"}

### Thu hồi quyền ADMIN
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"USER"}
